# This project's extra branch types and allowed names, read by .husky/check-branch-name
# and the branch-name CI job. One entry per line, # comments allowed.
#
# type <name>    adds <name> as a valid type, alongside Conventional Branches' own.
# allow <glob>   allows a whole branch name outright, in CI and the local hook.
#
# type spike
# allow snyk-*
# allow [0-9]*-*
